# SIKKHALOY-V3

Full project index: `PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md`

## Stack and target

- Primary app: `SIKKHALOY V2/` — ASP.NET Web Forms (.NET 4.7.2), assembly `EDUCATION.COM`
- Not MVC. Match existing Web Forms patterns; do not introduce new frameworks or DAL layers unless asked
- Satellite projects: `Attendance_API`, `AttendanceDevice`, `SmsService`, `ZKTeco_Manager`

## Page structure

New pages need the triplet: `.aspx` + `.aspx.cs` + `.designer.cs`

```aspx
<%@ Page MasterPageFile="~/BASIC.Master" CodeBehind="Page.aspx.cs"
    Inherits="EDUCATION.COM.Module.SubModule.Page" %>
```

Namespace: `EDUCATION.COM.{folder path}`. Shared SMS helpers may use `Education`.

## Data access

- Connection string: `EducationConnectionString` from `Web.config` (attendance: `AttendanceConnectionString`)
- Always parameterize `@SchoolID`, `@EducationYearID`, `@RegistrationID` from session
- Follow existing style: inline ADO.NET or `SqlDataSource` in markup — no new ORM in the main app
- SQL scripts: `Database_Scripts/` or `SIKKHALOY V2/Database/`

## Session and auth

Pages on `BASIC.Master` assume session is populated (`SchoolID`, `Edu_Year`, etc.). Use `Roles.IsUserInRole()` for access checks.

## Payments

- **ShurjoPay** — platform invoices, SMS recharge (`ShurjoPayService.cs`)
- **Amarpay** — per-school student fees (`Student/OnlinePayment/`)

## Conventions to preserve

- Page names: `PascalCase_With_Underscores.aspx`
- Folder spelling: `Handeler` (not Handler)
- Bengali/UTF-8 strings — do not break encoding
- Validation values: `'Valid'` / `'Invalid'`
- Minimize diff scope; match surrounding code style per `.editorconfig`
- Never commit secrets from `Web.config`
